    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Bees and other pollinators are indispensable for successful crop production and maintaining biodiversity. However, many Tanzanians, including farmers, conservationists, and researchers, lack a deep understanding of these vital creatures. To address this gap, the Aga Khan University's Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Centre (AKU-ACER) has partnered with BEEtopia to conduct research on non-Apis pollinators.",
